---
import StatCard from '@/components/ui/StatCard.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/data/site';
---

<section class="section bg-black-2" aria-label="Sunil's story">
  <div class="container mx-auto">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">

      <!-- Text -->
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">My story</p>
        <h2 class="headline text-4xl sm:text-5xl">
          From <span class="text-blood">4 reps</span><br />to world record
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-stone">
          <p>A world record doesn't tell you about the pain.</p>
          <p>When I trained clap pull-ups, my palms and fingers hurt so bad I couldn't grip the bar the next session. I didn't grind through it blind. I learned to program around it. Recovery, not just more reps.</p>
          <p>I started with four sloppy reps on a college goalpost. Bent knees, body swinging. The same mistakes I fix in every student now. I cleaned them up, kept going, and on June 21, 2025, I set the world record.</p>
          <p>This bootcamp runs on the method I built on myself first.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats + photo -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <!-- Photo -->
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black-2 aspect-[4/3]">
          <img
            src="/sunil-record.jpg"
            alt="Sunil Khadka breaking the Guinness World Record"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover opacity-80"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            onerror="this.parentElement.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Stat row -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
          <StatCard number="4" label="Starting reps" />
          <StatCard number="32+" label="Clap Pull-Ups/min WR" accent={true} />
          <StatCard number={String(SITE.bootcamp.durationDays)} label="Days in bootcamp" />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
